---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Dad Knows Dungeons is a TTRPG Game Master podcast and campaign journal — honest advice, actual-play campaigns, and dice-and-parchment charm from two working dads."
---
{% set featuredEpisode = collections.podcastEpisodes | first %}
{% set featuredCampaign = collections.campaigns | first %}
{% set latestJournal = collections.journal | head(3) %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">A GM notebook for the rest of us</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Tabletop wisdom from two dads who'd rather be rolling dice.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">{{ site.description }}</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/podcast/">Listen to the podcast</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/campaigns/">Browse our campaigns</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__art">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-table.svg" alt="Illustration of a tabletop with a map, dice, and character sheets" loading="eager">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow text-center">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Our mission</p>
    <h2>Make the game table welcoming, not intimidating.</h2>
    <p class="hero__lede" style="margin-inline: auto;">We started Dad Knows Dungeons to prove you don't need a studio, a hundred minis, or a decade of experience to run a great game — just a little prep, a willing table, and the nerve to say "yes, and."</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if featuredEpisode %}
<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="mb-0">Featured episode</h2>
      <a class="section-heading__link" href="/podcast/">All episodes &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/episode-card.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if featuredCampaign %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="mb-0">Featured campaign</h2>
      <a class="section-heading__link" href="/campaigns/">All campaigns &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% set campaign = featuredCampaign %}
      {% include "partials/campaign-card.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if latestJournal.length %}
<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="mb-0">Latest from the journal</h2>
      <a class="section-heading__link" href="/journal/">Read the journal &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for post in latestJournal %}
      {% include "partials/journal-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="newsletter">
      <h2>Never miss a session recap</h2>
      <p>One email a week: new episodes, journal entries, and the occasional GM tip we wish we'd known sooner.</p>
      <form class="newsletter__form" action="#" method="post">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="newsletter-email">Email address</label>
        <input class="newsletter__input" id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
        <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
